  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi4W-wCUygrPBf0CnEp7egbXeMMZdZe0436SOM4sHr-fzxivQw4hoflehP1UUweyjl-LbzseeTD5jt6vHgTcpuQtd0-AhaY8x_Y0thSubrMKtfLjuntF8VfNcARee7mpH33ZD3Jf-k-heXhZ2pG_gdMCjAyJF1ximdykaMHIsrh4q_ZlADqkwGrCsuaXiQ/s420/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.GIF\"><img alt=\"בני משפחה סביב ארון קבורה פתוח ובו מחשב נייד. הם מנסים לנחש את הסיסמה\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi4W-wCUygrPBf0CnEp7egbXeMMZdZe0436SOM4sHr-fzxivQw4hoflehP1UUweyjl-LbzseeTD5jt6vHgTcpuQtd0-AhaY8x_Y0thSubrMKtfLjuntF8VfNcARee7mpH33ZD3Jf-k-heXhZ2pG_gdMCjAyJF1ximdykaMHIsrh4q_ZlADqkwGrCsuaXiQ/w320-h320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.GIF\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">הצד השני של ה(מ)טבע</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַחֲרֵי מוֹת</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">📣</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁלֹּא תִּהְיֶינָה סְפֵקוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָז אֲנִי מֵרֹאשׁ מוֹדִיעַ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁזֶּה הוֹלֵךְ לִהְיוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">טוּר מַמָּשׁ פָּרוּעַ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🐄</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נִשְׁבֹּר בְּחֶדְוָה מֻסְכָּמוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְלֹא פּוֹלִיטִיקְלִי&nbsp;קוֹרֵקְט.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נִשְׁחַט פָּרוֹת קְדוֹשׁוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נְדַבֵּר עַל חַי וּמֵת.</span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🦻</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מָה שֶׁהִתְחִיל בִּצְנִיחַת עַפְעַפַּיִם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבְמַכְשִׁיר שְׁמִיעָה קָטָן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הִמְשִׁיךְ בִּנְפִילַת אַפַּיִם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַכְשָׁיו הִנְנִי כָּאן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">📜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָמְנָם 'אֲנִי מֵת עֲלֵיכֶם',</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבְמוֹתִי, אֲצַוֶּה לָכֶם חַיִּים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל, דַּוְקָא מִפְּנֵי כֵן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶרְשֹׁם כַּמָּה דְּבָרִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👯</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יֵשׁ שֶׁמֵּתִים מִפַּחַד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲחֵרִים פּוֹחֲדִים מֵהִתְמוֹטְטוּת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָעִקָּר שֶׁתִּשָּׁאֲרוּ יַחַד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי מָוֶת, זֶה לֹא הִתְפַּטְּרוּת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">💻</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זוֹ בְּעָיָה בָּעוֹלָם הַמּוֹדֶרְנִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּשֶׁלֹּא נִשְׁאַר מָה לְהוֹרִישׁ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁהֲרֵי כָּל חֵפֶץ הוּא גֵּנֵרִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְקַיָּם כְּבָר אֵצֶל כָּל אִישׁ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">⌚</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוֹרְשִׁים, כְּבָר לֹא הוֹלְכִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עִם שְׁעוֹנֵי זָהָב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנָשִׁים כְּבָר לֹא אוֹסְפִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פִּסְלוֹנֵי שֶׁנְהָב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">📮</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תְּמוּנָה הִיא עִנְיָן שֶׁל טַעַם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּגָדִים קוֹנִים בְּזוֹל.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲפִילּוּ אֹסֶף בּוּלִים מִפַּעַם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵינוֹ עִנְיָן גָּדוֹל.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">♿</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">(אָמְנָם בַּמִּקְרֶה שֶׁלִּי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַמַּצָּב קְצָת שׁוֹנֶה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי יֵשׁ לִי אֲבִיזָר יִחוּדִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּסֵּא נָכֶה מְפַתֶּה.)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🔑</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָז, אַחֲרֵי הִתְלַבְּטוּיוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּסְפֵקוֹת מְיַסְּרִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹרִישׁ לָכֶם סִסְמָאוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּנִיסָה לְכָל הָאֲתָרִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">💤</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַכְשָׁו תִּזְכְּרוּ אֶת הַהוֹרָאוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי לֹא תִּהְיֶה הִזְדַּמְּנוּת שְׁנִיָּה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תִּמְחֲקוּ מֵהַטֵּלֵפוֹן אֶת הַזִּכְרוֹנוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי לֹא רוֹצֶה הַפְרָעוֹת בַּשֵּׁנָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🍂</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֲכִי טוֹב לָמוּת בַּסְּתָו,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֶזֶג הָאֲוִיר פְּצָצָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל לֹא אוּכַל לָתֵת עַכְשָׁו,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הִתְחַיְּבוּת אוֹ הַבְטָחָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🌂</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תָּמִיד תָּבִיאוּ מִטְרִיּוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נֶגֶד גֶּשֶׁם אוֹ חַמָּה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִטְרִיּוֹת שְׁחֹרוֹת גְּדוֹלוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עוֹשׂוֹת&nbsp;טוֹב לַנְּשָׁמָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🕯️</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תְּדַבְּרוּ בְּלָשׁוֹן יָפָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי הַכֹּל אֲנִי אֶשְׁמַע.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִבַּעַד לַזְּכוּכִית הַדַּקָּה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁל כּוּךְ נֵרוֹת הַנְּשָׁמָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">😕</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רֶגַע, אֵיפֹה הָיִיתִי?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תֵּכֶף אֲנִי מְסַיֵּם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַזָּל שֶׁהַכֹּל כָּתַבְתִּי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַצָּב דֶּמֶנְצִיָּה&nbsp;מִתְקַדֵּם...</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🚪</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַל תַּגִּידוּ 'הִתְבַּקֵּשׁ',</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">'עָלָה לִישִׁיבָה שֶׁל מַעְלָה'.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּבָר שָׁנִים שֶׁאֲנִי לֹא דּוֹפֵק,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵצֶל הַשָּׁכֵן מֵהַוַּעַד לְמַעְלָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🆓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תָּמִיד פָּרַצְתִּי מִסְגְּרוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָיִיתִי נֶפֶשׁ חָפְשִׁיָּה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הִמָּנְעוּ מֵאוֹתִיּוֹת מְרֻבָּעוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּמּוֹדָעָה הַמְּמֻסְגֶּרֶת הַשְּׁחֹרָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🧩</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹמְרִים שֶׁהַחַיִּים הֵם חִידָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל הַמָּוֶת אֵינוֹ פִּתְרוֹן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תָּמִיד זוֹ פַּעַם רִאשׁוֹנָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קָשֶׁה לִצְבֹּר נִיסָּיוֹן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🎓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא עָבַרְתִּי קוּרְס הַדְרָכָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאֵין לִי שׁוּם הַסְמָכָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָכֵן יֵשׁ לִי הַרְבֵּה שְׁאֵלוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאֵין סוֹף הִתְלַבְּטוּיוֹת:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1️⃣</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם רֵיחַ הַפְּרָחִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גּוֹבֵר עַל רֵיחַ נֵרוֹת הַנְּשָׁמָה?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי פָּשׁוּט קְצָת אָלֶרְגִּי לִפְעָמִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְזֶה עוֹשֶׂה לִי בְּחִילָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">2️⃣</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם כְּדַאי לִכְתֹּב 'שְׂבַע יָמִים',</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַל מִי שֶׁעָבַר קִצּוּר קֵבָה?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם חַיָּבִים לְהַחֲזִיר צִיּוּדִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּדֵי לְקַבֵּל תְּעוּדַת פְּטִירָה?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">⏳</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַךְ דַּי לִהְיוֹת דְּרָמָטִי</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּלוּם כְּבָר לֹא חָשׁוּב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וַאֲפִילּוּ אִם הִסְתַּלַּקְתִּי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תִּזְכְּרוּ שֶׁתֵּכֶף אָשׁוּב...</span></p>"
}
